    "everywhere it can honestly go, which is the right default for almost every term.",
    "",
    "NOTE is for a caution the rep needs before they open the tab, not a description.",
    "",
    "\u26a0\ufe0f THE REP IS NOT HERE TO SELL. These terms find conversations worth joining. A term",
